Token Created
Run this command to store the token on your computer.

Refer to the documentation about configuration for how to set credentials via environment variables instead.

modal token set --token-id ak-OjMzv3fwvtzInjELtQmlAP --token-secret as-tVok5vpeGmu18ujFEPfcYt --profile=testing-123
Copy
This stores the token in a profile named testing-123. To activate, run:

modal profile activate testing-123
Copy
This is the last time you can see the token!
